=Sensor Drone=
*  Health: 4
*  Price: %Minerals% 40
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 11
*  Can safely fall down 1 height level
*  Stationary on ground (supported by water)
*  Speed: 10 (aerial)
Suborbital planes move above the regular terrain. They can scan the surface, and are invisible to ordinary radar.
